{"content":[{"c":["RODANIM"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Fourth son of Javan and a descendant of Noah through Japheth’s line (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.7","r":"1Chr.1.7","rawR":"1Chr.1.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.7","value":"1Chr.1.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:7"},"). An alternate spelling in ",{"href":"?bref=Gen.10.4","r":"Gen.10.4","rawR":"Gen.10.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.10.4","value":"Gen.10.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Genesis 10:4"}," reads Dodanim, possibly a copyist’s error. Both words probably refer to the Greek peoples of Rhodes and its neighboring islands in the Aegean Sea."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Rodanim","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.1.7","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.1.7","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.1.7"},{"anchorText":"Genesis 10:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.10.4","rawQueryValue":"Gen.10.4","sourceRefExact":"Gen.10.4"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"f0b2f1a7dac3fe425d14ce8f61700d979265e8f876fe1b7b8241085de47b86dc","sourceItemName":"Rodanim","sourceItemOrder":167,"sourceMember":"Articles/R.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Rodanim","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Rodanim","title":"Rodanim","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}